---
layout: model.njk
title: "Ten essays, each tied to a layer."
name: "Essays"
description: "A ten-part series on the AI-native organisation across four layers, plus a library of what I am reading and listening to, tested against what I have built."
---
<section class="m-sec">
  <span class="m-eyebrow">Series · The AI-native organisation</span>
  <h1>Ten essays, each tied to a layer.</h1>
  <p class="m-lede">The layer pages show the pattern. The essays work through the mechanism. New essays arrive here first, then on LinkedIn.</p>
  <div class="m-filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter by layer" data-essay-filter>
    <button type="button" class="m-chip" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {% for l in layers %}<button type="button" class="m-chip" data-filter="{{ l.key }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ l.n }} · {{ l.name }}</button>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div data-essay-list>{% set list = series %}{% include "partials/essay-list.njk" %}</div>
</section>

<section class="m-sec" id="library">
  <span id="notes" class="m-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <h2>Library</h2>
  <p class="m-small">What I'm reading and listening to, tested against what I've built, plus my own shorter notes. Each one is tied to a layer.</p>
  <div class="m-filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter the library" data-lib-filter>
    <button type="button" class="m-chip" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {% for l in layers %}<button type="button" class="m-chip" data-filter="{{ l.key }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ l.n }} · {{ l.name }}</button>{% endfor %}
    <button type="button" class="m-chip" data-filter="note" aria-pressed="false">My notes</button>
  </div>
  <ul class="m-lib" data-lib-list>
    {% for item in library | libraryItems(collections.notes) %}{% set l = layers | byKey(item.layer) if item.layer else null %}
    <li class="m-lib-item is-{{ item.kind }}" data-layer="{{ item.layer or '' }}" data-kind="{{ item.kind }}">
      <div class="m-lib-meta">
        {% if l %}<a class="m-lib-layer" href="/{{ l.slug }}/"><span class="m-num">{{ l.n }}</span>{{ l.name }}</a>{% endif %}
        <span class="m-lib-type">{{ item.type }}</span>
        <span>{{ item.by }}</span>
        <span>{% if item.kind == "reading" %}{{ item.published | monthYear }}{% else %}{{ item.year }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      <h3><a href="{{ item.url }}"{% if item.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ item.title }}{% if item.external %} <span class="m-ext" aria-label="opens the original">↗</span>{% endif %}</a></h3>
      {% if item.kind == "reading" %}
      <p class="m-lib-says">{{ item.says }}</p>
      <div class="m-lib-take"><span class="m-lib-take-k">My take{% if item.stance %} · <b class="st-{{ item.stance }}">{{ item.stance | stanceLabel }}</b>{% endif %}</span><p>{{ item.take }}</p></div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="m-lib-says">{{ item.says }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
